    {
      "@id": "jptr:compound-thcv",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": "jptr:compound-taxonomy",
      "skos:broader": "jptr:compound-minor",
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Tetrahydrocannabivarin (THCV)",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "テトラヒドロカンナビバリン (THCV)",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "THCV",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "THCv",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "compound_thcv",
      "skos:scopeNote": [
        {
          "@value": "No skos:exactMatch is asserted: this concept leaves the Δ8/Δ9 positional isomer and the stereochemistry unspecified, while every verified registry record is more specific. CHEBI:755032 and Wikidata Q76009679 denote a stereo-defined Δ9-THCV, and Wikidata Q254768 denotes Δ9-THCV with the stereochemistry unspecified; none denotes an isomer-unspecified THCV, so attaching one would assert Δ9. The records, their identifiers and the open mapping scope are documented in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md (ISS-20261115-TAX-043). This note states no chemical identity for any query result.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "`skos:exactMatch` は張らない。本概念は Δ8/Δ9 の位置異性体と立体化学を指定しておらず、検証済みの外部レコードはいずれもより特定的である。CHEBI:755032 と Wikidata Q76009679 は立体化学を定義した Δ9-THCV を、Wikidata Q254768 は立体化学を未指定にした Δ9-THCV を指す。異性体未指定の THCV を指す単一レコードは無いため、いずれかを付けると Δ9 を主張することになる。レコード・識別子・未決の範囲は docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md に記録した（ISS-20261115-TAX-043）。本記載は検索結果の化学的同一性を主張しない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "jptr:compound-cbdv",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": "jptr:compound-taxonomy",
      "skos:broader": "jptr:compound-minor",
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Cannabidivarin (CBDV)",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "カンナビジバリン (CBDV)",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "CBDV",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "compound_cbdv",
      "skos:scopeNote": [
        {
          "@value": "The concept leaves the stereochemistry unspecified, so its skos:exactMatch is Wikidata Q1104117, the item explicitly typed as a group of stereoisomers, not the stereo-defined record (CHEBI:182159 / Wikidata Q76421750). No ChEBI exactMatch is asserted because the only ChEBI entry for cannabidivarin is the stereo-defined one. Basis and records: docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md (ISS-20261115-TAX-043).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "本概念は立体化学を指定していないため、`skos:exactMatch` は立体異性体のグループとして明示された Wikidata Q1104117 とし、立体化学を定義したレコード（CHEBI:182159 / Wikidata Q76421750）は付けない。ChEBI の cannabidivarin は立体化学を定義した 1 件のみのため、ChEBI への `exactMatch` は張らない。根拠とレコードは docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md に記録した（ISS-20261115-TAX-043）。",
          "@language": "ja"
        }
      ],
      "skos:exactMatch": "wikidata:Q1104117"
    },
    {
      "@id": "jptr:compound-cbx",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": "jptr:compound-taxonomy",
      "skos:broader": "jptr:compound-minor",
      "skos:prefLabel": [
